    S->>C: GET /dna/intent/api/v1/task/a6fb...
    C-->>S: 200 isError false, endTime set, progress = fileId (JSON string)
    S->>C: GET /dna/intent/api/v1/file/589c...
    C-->>S: 200 [{"commandResponses": {"SUCCESS": {...}, ...}}]
